          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Nebukadnejar obino onyiko cok ki doggola me kabedo ka ma ruk mac tye ka lye iye-ni, ci owacci, “Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego, wun lutic pa Lubaŋa Mamalo Twal, wukatti woko, wubin kany!” Cutcut Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego gukatti woko ki i mac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci luloyo madoŋo, ki ludito pa lwak, ki luloc me dul lobo mapatpat kacel ki lumi-tam pa kaba ka gucokke kacel, ci guneno ni mac pe owaŋo jo-nu; yer wigi mo ma mac oroyo pe tye, ginarukagi bene mac pe ogudo, dok ŋwec mac bene obedo pe i komgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumiyo Nebukadnejar otuggi wacci, “Gipwo Lubaŋa pa Cadrak, ki Mecak ka Abednego ma ocwalo lamalaika ci olaro luticce woko, ma gigeno en, ma gubalo bene cik pa kabaka woko, gudyero kwogi me to ma ka woro lubaŋa mo ata ma pe Lubaŋagi kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi meno doŋ aketo cik kombeddi ni, Lwak me rok ducu nyo rok ducu mapatpat, nyo leb mo ma biloko lok mo marac i kom Lubaŋa pa Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego gibiŋidogi wo ko matitino, ki odigi bene gibimuko woko doŋ obur; pien doŋ pe tye lubaŋa mo mukene ma twero laro dano kit man,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumiyo kabaka ocako medo rwom me tic pa Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego i lobo Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
